# Raw large result files — keep normalized/ and history/ only
# Uncomment if results/raw/ grows too large:
# results/raw/*.txt
# results/raw/k6-*.json

# Raw JFR recordings are not committed.
#  - Enterprise track: HARD confidentiality rule — public mode default-denies .jfr
#    (extension + FLR\0 signature). Enterprise H3/locality recordings stay internal.
#  - Community / open-core: recordings are NOT secret (the code is open), but a JFR
#    is ~190 MB; git is the wrong place for 2+ GB of binaries. Publish derived
#    artifacts (flamegraph SVGs, extracted metrics JSON); share raw recordings on
#    request or as release/download assets, not in git history.
*.jfr
*.JFR

# h2load per-request --log-file dumps are huge (100+ MB each); the derived
# h2load-latency.json carries the percentiles. (Covered by *.log below too.)

# Per-sample sidecar CSVs (pidstat per-thread, mpstat per-CPU, resource samples):
# heavy raw streams (20K-35K rows each) that dominate the diff. The aggregated
# signal lives in resource-metrics.json / *-latency.json / steady-state-evidence.json;
# raw per-sample CSVs are kept out of git for size and available on request — same
# policy as .jfr above.
results/**/target-pidstat.csv
results/**/host-mpstat.csv
results/**/resource-samples.csv

# Environment files with real values — template is committed, actuals are not
runtime/drivers/env/*.env
!runtime/drivers/env/template.env

# Exeris enterprise confidentiality — enterprise provider classes in git-ignored env files
enterprise/env/enterprise-sysprops.env
env/.local/

# Temp
*.tmp
*.log

# Upstream installer scripts must not be committed
get-docker.sh

# Comparative benchmark quarantine and audit logs
quarantine/
comparative-audit.log
**/target-a-pidfile
**/target-b-pidfile
**/sync-log.txt

# Local-only artifacts — do not commit (triage 2026-07)
# JVM-error reproduction toolkit: downloaded + built JDKs (multi-GB libjvm.so, tarballs)
tools/jbs-repro/
# JVM-error reproduction target (JDK Loom×C2 h2-over-TLS crash) — repro only, not a benchmark target
targets/quarkus-benchmark-app-jdbc-jsse/
# Giant raw k6 stream captures (100s of MB each)
results/**/tools/k6/stream.json
# Scratch / experiment scripts and summaries
scripts/tmp-*.sh
/REFACTORING-ARENA-TO-LOANEDUFFER-SUMMARY.md

